# Railway deploy branch

Live Railway services always deploy from **`production`**, never from **`main`**.

| Repo | Branches | Railway |
|------|----------|---------|
| This repo (`payments-sdk`) | `main` + `production` | Docs / example-store from **`production`**. Packages publish from **`main`**. |
| Apps (`billing-hosting`, Autlantic platform) | `main` → `staging` → `production` | Staging and production Railway from those branches only. Never point Railway at `main`. |

Do not suggest wiring Railway source to `main`, or treating a push to `main` as a live deploy. Promote to `production` (apps: via `staging` first) before expecting Railway to update. See `DEPLOY.md`.
